sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as PresenceSensor
    participant Service as OccupancyService
    participant WebServer as WebServerAPI
    participant Actuator as IoTActuator
    participant AC as AirConditioner

    Note over Sensor, Service: Mensageria Assíncrona (Event-Driven)
    Sensor-)Service: processOccupancyEvent(OccupancyEventDTO)
    activate Service
    
    Note over Service, WebServer: Chamada Síncrona Bloqueante (API REST/RPC)
    Service->>WebServer: triggerDeviceAction(CommandDTO)
    deactivate Service
    activate WebServer
    
    Note over WebServer, Actuator: Chamada Síncrona Bloqueante
    WebServer->>Actuator: executeCommand(ActuatorCommandDTO)
    deactivate WebServer
    activate Actuator
    
    Note over Actuator, AC: Chamada Síncrona de Hardware
    Actuator->>AC: turnOff()
    activate AC
    AC-->>Actuator: StatusResponseDTO
    deactivate AC

    Note over Actuator, WebServer: Fragmento Combinado (Tratamento de Exceção / Retorno Alternativo)
    alt Sucesso no Desligamento
        Actuator-)WebServer: reportStatus(DeviceStatusDTO [status=OFF])
        activate WebServer
        Note over WebServer: Atualiza estado para OFFLINE
        deactivate WebServer
    else Falha de Comunicação / Timeout (Exceção)
        Actuator-)WebServer: reportStatus(ErrorDTO [error=TIMEOUT])
        activate WebServer
        WebServer->>WebServer: logError(LogDTO)
        deactivate WebServer
    end
    deactivate Actuator